          "create_time": 1792864153.636,
          "update_time": 1792864154.299,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "There is a clean complex formulation. The distinction is that \\(H\\) is holomorphic, while the amplitude \\(A\\) depends on both \\(z\\) and \\(\\bar z\\). Using both Wirtinger derivatives lets us replace the real Poisson equation with a first-order equation for a complex potential.\n"
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": false,
          "metadata": {
            "source": "Codex completed public message",
            "source_turn_id": "01a16f07-3978-78e1-a320-820a9251c28f",
