          "create_time": 1792864272.493,
          "update_time": 1792864273.318,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "I’d use the complex system as the main display and keep the real-coordinate version alongside it. The complex potential is an auxiliary field whose imaginary part recovers \\(V\\); it retains the original boundary-condition choices. I’m saving the derivation in the investigation’s notes.\n"
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
